I have created `solution.py` which converts Fahrenheit to Celsius and rounds the result to one decimal place as specified in `TASK.md`.
The `TASK.md` requires a function to convert Fahrenheit to Celsius, rounded to one decimal place, in a file named `solution.py`. The error message indicated that the test suite expects a function named `to_c`, but the existing code used `fahrenheit_to_celsius`. I have updated `solution.py` to include the `to_c` function.
